              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Usho kanje uJehova, uthi: “Bheka, ngiyakubuyisa isiphetho samatende kaJakobe, ngihawukele izindlu zakhe; umuzi uyakwakhiwa phezu kwethemba lawo, nesigodlo sime endleleni yawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.18",
